  "description": "After experiencing multiple diastrophisms, the Earth’s sea level rose exponentially.\n\nHoju wants to show his daughter, Han Byeol, the world and heads toward his hometown. There are multiple strange marks in the town he hasn't visited for 20 years… Will the two be able to survive safely?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=780404), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=6612961)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0002733), [T.Chinese](https://www.webtoons.com/zh-hant/mystery/cage-on-the-water/list?title_no=5485), [French](https://www.webtoons.com/fr/drama/enclos-sur-leau/list?title_no=5700)",
